 &lt;a class=&quot;hs-featured-image-link&quot; href=&quot;https://blog.pcisecuritystandards.org/the-ai-exchange-innovators-in-payment-security-featuring-coalfire&quot; title=&quot;&quot;&gt; &lt;img alt=&quot;The AI Exchange: Innovators in Payment Security Featuring Coalfire&quot; class=&quot;hs-featured-image&quot; src=&quot;https://blog.pcisecuritystandards.org/hubfs/2026-blog/Andy-barratt-blog.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width: auto !important; float: left; margin: 0 15px 15px 0;&quot; /&gt; &lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;/div&gt; 
&lt;br /&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the PCI Security Standards Council’s blog series, The AI Exchange: Innovators in Payment Security. This special, ongoing feature of our PCI Perspectives blog offers a resource for payment security industry stakeholders to exchange information about how they are adopting and implementing artificial intelligence (AI) into their organizations. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
